    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.poster.avif?t=1726330540\" width=512 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.webm?t=1726330540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.mp4?t=1726330540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to Jump Queen, a platformer whose goal is to get to the top.<br>In a gloomy tower overlooking the kingdom lives an evil vampire queen.<br>She brings terror and fear to everyone around her. Get to the very top, defeat the evil queen and bring peace back to your kingdom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>.Meet the main character who has three types of jump. Choose the right jump type and jump up.<br><br><strong>- Hold down the space bar to accumulate jump strength and release it to jump!</strong><br>Choosing the right jump force is not as easy as it seems at first glance.<br><br><strong>- Think before you jump! </strong><br>Once you have jumped, there is no turning back.<br>The higher you climb, the more unpleasant it will be for you to fall down.<br><br><strong>- Fight or don't fight</strong>.<br>Sometimes, you will encounter enemies. You can engage them in combat or avoid combat.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search for lives.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/0dccdf0ddd92907ff360e0b0f98921bd.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br></li><li>Collect Coins.<br>You can buy additional lives with coins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/160c1381160f44fdaaa1375627a74c66.avif?t=1726330540\" width=598 height=198 /></span>.<br><br><br></li><li>Find a store to increase your lives or buy a new look! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/092ef2d3685d53e77b060e9c6d1c872f.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span>.<br><br></li><li>A look changes the heroine's appearance and gives her new abilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/f6e1e234c3ac5063a2e8d354c887d530.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=280 /></span>.<br><br><br></li><li>Collect gems. For the gems you will be able to make appearance upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/76df3db7bdc24b627ee35ca1503e7876.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span>.<br><br>How many guises are there in the game? Let's do the math.<br>Right now there are 3 skins and 5 types of armor in the game - a total of 15 types of guises.<br>But! Each cloak has 3 upgrades - that means 45 different variants of the hero's characteristics! Prepare your gems.<br><br></li><li> Portals, secrets, is there a hell and a heaven? Is it worth searching for answers to these questions or is it better to just jump up?</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.poster.avif?t=1726330540\" width=512 height=384 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.webm?t=1726330540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/e4e9cf519ef4a69dbf2e74a433156531.mp4?t=1726330540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Welcome to Jump Queen, a platformer whose goal is to get to the top.<br>In a gloomy tower overlooking the kingdom lives an evil vampire queen.<br>She brings terror and fear to everyone around her. Get to the very top, defeat the evil queen and bring peace back to your kingdom.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>.Meet the main character who has three types of jump. Choose the right jump type and jump up.<br><br><strong>- Hold down the space bar to accumulate jump strength and release it to jump!</strong><br>Choosing the right jump force is not as easy as it seems at first glance.<br><br><strong>- Think before you jump! </strong><br>Once you have jumped, there is no turning back.<br>The higher you climb, the more unpleasant it will be for you to fall down.<br><br><strong>- Fight or don't fight</strong>.<br>Sometimes, you will encounter enemies. You can engage them in combat or avoid combat.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Search for lives.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/0dccdf0ddd92907ff360e0b0f98921bd.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span><br><br></li><li>Collect Coins.<br>You can buy additional lives with coins.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/160c1381160f44fdaaa1375627a74c66.avif?t=1726330540\" width=598 height=198 /></span>.<br><br><br></li><li>Find a store to increase your lives or buy a new look! <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/092ef2d3685d53e77b060e9c6d1c872f.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span>.<br><br></li><li>A look changes the heroine's appearance and gives her new abilities. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/f6e1e234c3ac5063a2e8d354c887d530.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=280 /></span>.<br><br><br></li><li>Collect gems. For the gems you will be able to make appearance upgrades.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2576190/extras/76df3db7bdc24b627ee35ca1503e7876.avif?t=1726330540\" width=600 height=200 /></span>.<br><br>How many guises are there in the game? Let's do the math.<br>Right now there are 3 skins and 5 types of armor in the game - a total of 15 types of guises.<br>But! Each cloak has 3 upgrades - that means 45 different variants of the hero's characteristics! Prepare your gems.<br><br></li><li> Portals, secrets, is there a hell and a heaven? Is it worth searching for answers to these questions or is it better to just jump up?</li></ul>",
